      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TOP THE LOT (8) boasts a consistent overall record including seven wins from 15 starts, the latest hitting the minor money when second (22.05) over 390m at this track. Boxed wide but will go close with the right run. SANDAVE STAPLES (1) missed the frame last time when fourth (30.89) at this track but prior to that had two placings in a row. Solid record here winning five races. Unbeaten from this box in four starts. Great chance to atone. RAPID SPITFIRE (2) showed good early speed but faded to a close fifth (19.34) at Q Straight over 350m. Returns to favourable track. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. NEW YORK LIBERTY (3) is in the mix despite finishing out of the placings here last start.",
